        <Key ID="STR_diw_vehicle_plates_main_allowPlateReplace">
            <English>Allow replacing damaged plate</English>
            <French>Permettre le remplacement de la plaque endommagée</French>
            <Polish>Zezwól na zastępowanie uszkodzonych płyt</Polish>
            <Korean>손상된 방탄판 교체 허용</Korean>
            <Chinese>允許更換損壞的插板</Chinese>
            <Chinesesimp>允许更换损坏的插板</Chinesesimp>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_diw_vehicle_plates_main_allowPlateReplace_desc">
            <English>Allows people to replace damaged plates, the damaged plate will be discarded</English>
            <French>Permet de remplacer les plaques endommagées, la plaque endommagée étant mise au rebut.</French>
            <Polish>Zezwól graczom na zastępowanie uszkodzonych płyt nowymi. Te zniszczone znikną.</Polish>
            <Korean>손상된 방탄판 교체를 허용합니다. 손상된 방탄판은 버려집니다.</Korean>
            <Chinese>允許玩家更換損壞的插板,更換下的插板將被丟棄</Chinese>
            <Chinesesimp>允许玩家更换损坏的插板,更换下的插板将被丢弃</Chinesesimp>
        </Key>
        <Key ID="STR_diw_vehicle_plates_main_vehicleBlacklist">
